WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.688
We are going grocery shopping. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.688 --> 00:00:09.744
We take a basket or a trolley at the door.

3
00:00:09.744 --> 00:00:14.424
We find the items on our list, one by one.

4
00:00:14.424 --> 00:00:20.328
If we cannot find something, we can ask a worker: where is the ...?

5
00:00:20.328 --> 00:00:25.008
We join the queue at the checkout and wait our turn.

6
00:00:25.008 --> 00:00:31.392
We put our items on the belt. The belt moves them to the till.

7
00:00:31.392 --> 00:00:37.440
The till shows the price. We pay with our card or cash.

8
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:43.272
We pack our bags and take our receipt. Shopping done.

9
00:00:43.272 --> 00:00:51.480
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

